{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>Amazon 現正為 Marshall 藍牙喇叭全線推出優惠，主打型號 Acton III 減幅達 43%，現價只需 US$169.99，這款主打型號送海外要加 US$16 運費，但扣除運費也比本地價格便宜不少，因此很值得考慮！</p><figure><p><img alt=\"Marshall Kilburn III 便攜藍牙喇叭\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/54c32db4c657d65804ea64b2b12f792d0ac41c6e6df20baa5b5636aa25c176fa/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2Ffc55ef22684e3a8c6812ab8480fa1ac8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><figure><p><img alt=\"Marshall Emberton III 便攜防水藍牙喇叭\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/640a6e31c986e48c09b13581f013be78ba856770546152d4d208afa809b72571/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2Fe69979a2af471e7eae38baabe32db4c1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p>其他型號同樣享有大幅折扣，其中 Emberton III 現價 US$119.99、Kilburn III 現價 US$329.99，而體積最細的 Willen II 更是低至 US$79.99。雖然部分型號可免運費直送香港，但建議大家趁著這波全面降價，把握機會將心儀的音響產品帶回家。</p><p></p><figure><p><img alt=\"Marshall Willen II 迷你藍牙喇叭\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c3abd7f34fc80a793d9a6ddaa608617006cd819c3fb6bf15eb7eeab877ae3d8a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2Fc5d67efc16d03e9ba75819a7821f78eb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><h2>Marshall 藍牙喇叭全線優惠重點功能</h2><ul><li><p><strong>家用與戶外兼備設計</strong>：Acton III 採用 2 路驅動並更新波導技術，音場更闊且具備自動音量平衡；其餘型號則主打 IP67 防塵防水，適合沙灘露營或派對使用。</p></li><li><p><strong>超長播放時間續航</strong>：Emberton III 提供超過 32 小時播放，Kilburn III 更長達 50+ 小時，即使全天外出也不用擔心電量不足，隨時享受無線音樂體驗。</p></li><li><p><strong>標誌性復古外觀風格</strong>：全線沿用 Marshall 經典仿結他音箱造型，支援藍牙連接手機、平板及電腦，Acton III 另設 3.5mm 輸入方便接駁黑膠唱盤等設備。</p></li></ul><p><p></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p></p><p>[amazon box=\"B0FBHSDPBX\" /][amazon box=\"B0DDCJMDJC\" /][amazon box=\"B0F96FWCDF\" /][amazon box=\"B0DD7T8H2Q\" /]</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T09:55:18.926088+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":642,"images":3,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T09:20:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T18:35:52.384254+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T09:48:47.339132+00:00","content_hash":"aa74d81adc0ce6dc28f6006c88319ad3cf93a3859a4db19db7bb50d6e47d966b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}